aten hot or cold and served as an entire meal. The recipe will feed four with leftovers and keeps for a week refrigerated.\n\n== Ingredients ==\n\n=== Base ===\n*½ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[Cookbook:Oil|oil]]\n*¼ teaspoon [[Cookbook:Mustard Seed|mustard seeds]]\n*½ teaspoon [[Cookbook:Tumeric|tumeric]]\n*1 [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] dry brown [[Cookbook:Rice|rice]]\n*1 cup dry [[Cookbook:Mung Bean|mung beans]]\n*5½ cups [[Cookbook:Water|water]]\n*1½ teaspoons [[Cookbook:Cumin|cumin]]\n*1 teaspoon [[Cookbook:Curry Powder|curry powder]]\n*¼ teaspoon [[Cookbook:Pepper|pepper]]\n*¼ teaspoon powdered [[Cookbook:Ginger|ginger]]\n*1 teaspoon [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n*1 cup finely-[[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]] [[Cookbook:Cabbage|cabbage]]\n*1 cup chopped [[Cookbook:Bell Pepper|green pepper]]\n*1 cup finely-shredded [[Cookbook:Carrot|carrots]]\n=== Marinade ===\n\n*1½ cups oil\n*⅓ cup [[Cookbook:Lemon Juice|lemon juice]]\n*½ teaspoon salt\n*½ teaspoon [[Cookbook:Soy Sauce|soy sauce]]\n*1 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tablespoon]] [[Cookbook:Honey|honey]]\n*1 teaspoon [[Cookbook:Basil|basil]]\n*¼ teaspoon ground [[Cookbook:Oregano|oregano]]\n\n== Procedure ==\n\n#Heat the oil in a large pan.\n#Add the mustard seeds.\n#When they begin to pop, add the turmeric and [[Cookbook:Folding|fold]] in the rice and beans until coated with oil.\n#Add the rest of the spices and water.\n#[[Cookbook:Simmering|Simmer]] for about 45 minutes; most of the water will be absorbed.\n#Remove from heat and add vegetables.\n#Make the marinade and pour mix in.\n\n[[Category:Vegan recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using mung bean]]\n[[Category:Recipes using rice]]\n[[Category:Recipes for salad]]\n[[Category:Recipes using basil]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cabbage]]\n[[Category:Recipes using carrot]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lemon juice]]\n[[Category:Recipes using curry powder]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ground ginger]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cumin]]\n[[Category:Recipes using honey]]\n[[Category:Recipes using mus